<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Website Checkup — Jo Builds</title>
<meta name="description" content="Find out what's actually costing you customers on your website. No jargon, no £140/month subscription — just what's broken and how to fix it." />

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=cabinet-grotesk@400,500,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <a href="https://jobuilds.co.uk" class="eyebrow-link">← Jo Builds</a>

  <h1 id="headline">Stop paying £140 a month<br>for a report you can't read.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Paste your website below. In under a minute you'll know exactly what's costing you customers — in plain English, not marketing jargon.</p>

  <form class="audit-form" id="audit-form">
    <input type="text" id="url-input" placeholder="yourbusiness.co.uk" autocomplete="off" required />
    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" id="submit-btn">Check my site</button>
  </form>
  <p class="form-hint">Free to check. Full report is a one-off <span id="price-hint">£15</span>.</p>
  <p class="error-msg" id="error-msg" style="display:none;"></p>

  <!-- Loading sequence -->
  <div class="loading-block" id="loading-block">
    <ul class="loading-steps" id="loading-steps">
      <li data-step="0"><span class="step-icon">🐌</span><span>Checking if your site loads faster than a snail</span></li>
      <li data-step="1"><span class="step-icon">📱</span><span>Checking if it actually works on a phone</span></li>
      <li data-step="2"><span class="step-icon">🔍</span><span>Checking if Google can even find you</span></li>
      <li data-step="3"><span class="step-icon">📞</span><span>Checking if anyone can tell how to contact you</span></li>
      <li data-step="4"><span class="step-icon">🔒</span><span>Checking whether it looks trustworthy</span></li>
      <li data-step="5"><span class="step-icon">✍️</span><span>Writing up the verdict</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Teaser result -->
  <div class="result-block" id="result-block">
    <p class="roast" id="roast-text"></p>

    <div class="score-row">
      <span class="score-number" id="score-number">—</span>
      <span class="score-label">out of 100</span>
    </div>

    <div class="category-grid" id="category-grid"></div>

    <p class="issue-count" id="issue-count"></p>

    <div class="paywall">
      <h3>See exactly what to fix</h3>
      <p>The full report breaks down every check above — what's wrong, why it matters, and what to do about it. Sent straight to your inbox too.</p>
      <p class="price">One-off payment — <span id="price-text">£15</span></p>
      <button class="btn-primary" id="pay-btn">Unlock full report</button>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
  // Point this at your deployed Worker route, e.g. same-origin under /website-checkup/api
  const API_BASE = '/website-checkup/api';
</script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
